        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Weslock 2074-2104, Colonial Dummy Entry Handleset</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nWith a solid brass exterior, the Weslock Colonial Dummy Entry Handleset features a textured antique brass finish. It has just enough beautiful details to make it a point of interest for your door while adding an early American style to your home. A dummy handleset, the Weslock made Wiltshire Entryset is just for looks; it neither latches nor locks. Dummy handlesets are most often used as a pull or on the inactive side of double doors to match the existing trim. The Colonial Dummy Handleset not only looks fantastic, it is made with the attention to quality Weslock is known for.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Dummy Cylinder Handleset:</b> This handleset does not function--neither locking nor latching.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAlso available matching: <br>\r\n<a href=\"/products/single-cylinder-colonial-handleset-weslock-2175-2100\"><b>Colonial Single Cylinder Handleset</b></a><br>\r\n<a href=\"/products/double-cylinder-colonial-handleset-weslock-2175-2109\"><b>Colonial Double Handleset</b></a><br>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThis classically designed handleset is from the <a href=\"/collections/weslock-traditionale-collection\"><b>Weslock Traditionale Collection</b></a> which features solid brass construction and lifetime mechanical and finish warranties.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features</b> of the Weslock Colonial Dummy Entryset:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Solid brass exterior.</li>\r\n<li>Removable knobs prevents scratching during installation.</li>\r\n<li><b>Limited Lifetime Mechanical Warranty</b></li>\r\n<li><b>Limited Lifetime Finish Warranty</b></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the Traditionale Series Weslock Colonial Dummy Entry Handleset:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Finish: <b>Antique Brass</b></li>\r\n<li>Exterior Handle Length: 18\"</li>\r\n<li>Exterior Handle Projection: 2-1/2\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>The finish for the inside knob you choose will be Antique Brass to match the handleset.</i>\r\n</p>",
